                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr.
                            Snyder.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-08-12"><hi rendition="#italic">August 12,
                        1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Hay instructs Mr. Snyder to convey to General Reyes congratulations on his
                    entrance upon the Presidency.)</p>
